    "optimizedContext": {
      "value": "# VCS Adapter Factory\n\n## Rules\n- `createVcsAdapter(cwd?)` async, defaults `process.cwd()`, returns `Promise<VcsAdapter>` including identity resolution and modified-file enumeration.\n- Probe registered external providers in registration order, then built-ins: git, hg, svn. Stop after first match; no match → `NullVcsAdapter`, never throw.\n- Built-in git/Mercurial/Subversion roots: absolute; uppercase Windows drive; no `realpath`; valid subsequent VCS CWD. `NullVcsAdapter.rootDir()` throws.\n- Built-in modified paths use `/`; preserve `.`/`..`. Windows git/hg/svn spawns hide console.\n\n## Constraints\n- Detection uses VCS CLI process probes; non-zero means absent.\n- `GitVcsAdapter`, `HgVcsAdapter`, `SvnVcsAdapter`, `NullVcsAdapter` internal; public boundary `VcsAdapter` only.",
      "schema": {
        "name": "schema-std",
        "version": 1
      },
